    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world where information is the most valuable asset, your mission is to obtain data that could change the course of scientific progress and shape the future. By taking control of a miniature cockroach, you\u2019ll infiltrate restricted areas, bypass security systems, and face unexpected challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Gameplay:</strong> Take control of a cockroach and experience what it\u2019s like to be the smallest yet most crucial agent.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stealth and Strategy:</strong> Your tiny size is both an advantage and a limitation. Use it wisely.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engaging Storyline:</strong> Immerse yourself in a thrilling narrative where no choice is ever simple.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzles and Secrets:</strong> Pay close attention to details and use your wits to overcome traps and uncover hidden truths.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready for a mission where your eyes, ears, and legs belong to a tiny spy?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world where information is the most valuable asset, your mission is to obtain data that could change the course of scientific progress and shape the future. By taking control of a miniature cockroach, you\u2019ll infiltrate restricted areas, bypass security systems, and face unexpected challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Gameplay:</strong> Take control of a cockroach and experience what it\u2019s like to be the smallest yet most crucial agent.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stealth and Strategy:</strong> Your tiny size is both an advantage and a limitation. Use it wisely.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engaging Storyline:</strong> Immerse yourself in a thrilling narrative where no choice is ever simple.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzles and Secrets:</strong> Pay close attention to details and use your wits to overcome traps and uncover hidden truths.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready for a mission where your eyes, ears, and legs belong to a tiny spy?</p>",
    "short_description": "A spy mission with an unusual agent - a cockroach - awaits you! Infiltrate the scientist's house, bypass guards, hack into systems and solve puzzles. But be careful: you're just a small insect. Are you ready to become the most stealthy spy ever?",
